    "publicationType": "photobook",
    "originalTitle": "MAXQ Special Edition 3호",
    "englishTitle": "MAXQ Special Edition Vol. 3: Muscle Mania Four Beauties of Fantasy Island",
    "summary": "Digital MAXQ Special Edition Vol. 3, featuring Jeong Hanna (정한나), Lee Ha-rin (이하린), Kang Ju-yeon (강주연), and Lee Seon-i (이선이). RIDI lists the exact work as a 41-page PDF e-book released 2020-12-24 and describes the Special Edition series as an online photobook of selected MAXQ pictorials. A contemporaneous report relaying MAXQ's credits names these four as the Vol. 3 models. Maeil Business separately identifies Jeong Hanna as a fitness influencer. Photo overlap with the models' other MAXQ issues has not been checked. Bibliographic metadata only; no cover or paid PDF was copied.",
